message: "If you use this repository, cite the exact commit or release tag and the original dataset/software publications."
title: "YOLO-Based Vehicle Detection Under Adverse Environmental Conditions"
type: software
version: 1.0.1
date-released: 2026-09-02
authors:
  - family-names: Kureshi
    given-names: "Varis Jahirbhai"
repository-code: "https://github.com/varisjaher2004-byte/Vehicle_Detection_Adverse_Weather"
url: "https://github.com/varisjaher2004-byte/Vehicle_Detection_Adverse_Weather"
abstract: >-
  Reproducible MSc research artefacts for evaluating a YOLOv8l detector across
  prepared ACDC, corrected DAWN and Combined adverse-weather domains, including
  a non-destructive label correction, a seven-cell cross-domain validation
  matrix, checkpoint lineage and bounded CARLA qualitative diagnostics.
keywords:
  - object detection
  - adverse weather
  - YOLOv8
  - domain shift
  - ACDC
  - DAWN
  - CARLA
